WEBVTT

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.578
Wow, so once I got to know this,

00:07:30.578 --> 00:07:36.110
I was like, if something odd can teach me
such a valuable lesson of life,

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.900
I'm sure there is something interesting
about the even numbers as well.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.300
(Laughter)

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.877
So, let's look at table
of two, for example.

00:07:55.057 --> 00:08:01.081
What I notice here is every time,
right from the beginning to the end,